{"4798970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I'm Having A Bad Day", "steam_appid": 4798970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Created as a compact and physical VR experience, I’m Having a Bad Day is a cartoon-style game built around a simple idea: breaking things can be fun.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE SHOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a contestant in a fictional reality show set across different environments. The goal is simple: smash, dismantle, and create as much controlled chaos as possible within a short time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/c8eeaa32d913b6f48f46aee6f2e09eb9.poster.avif?t=1785151692\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/c8eeaa32d913b6f48f46aee6f2e09eb9.webm?t=1785151692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/c8eeaa32d913b6f48f46aee6f2e09eb9.mp4?t=1785151692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS SIMULATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objects react with exaggerated cartoon physics and clear visual feedback. Power-ups, such as oversized tools or jelly weapons, temporarily shift the pace and encourage different approaches to destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/85c6c4f9837479827b5df2936203781e.poster.avif?t=1785151692\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/85c6c4f9837479827b5df2936203781e.webm?t=1785151692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/85c6c4f9837479827b5df2936203781e.mp4?t=1785151692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENERGY &amp; FUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game is not designed as a fitness experience, you may find that after demolishing a couple of environments you feel unexpectedly energized especially after a long or stressful day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/0f6d7a3e096da50b3014aa4d924f5679.poster.avif?t=1785151692\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/0f6d7a3e096da50b3014aa4d924f5679.webm?t=1785151692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/0f6d7a3e096da50b3014aa4d924f5679.mp4?t=1785151692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I’m Having a Bad Day is a straightforward, physics-driven VR game built around short bursts of action and repeatable levels, created for players who enjoy quick sessions and physical interaction in virtual space.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Created as a compact and physical VR experience, I’m Having a Bad Day is a cartoon-style game built around a simple idea: breaking things can be fun.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE SHOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a contestant in a fictional reality show set across different environments. The goal is simple: smash, dismantle, and create as much controlled chaos as possible within a short time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/c8eeaa32d913b6f48f46aee6f2e09eb9.poster.avif?t=1785151692\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/c8eeaa32d913b6f48f46aee6f2e09eb9.webm?t=1785151692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/c8eeaa32d913b6f48f46aee6f2e09eb9.mp4?t=1785151692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS SIMULATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objects react with exaggerated cartoon physics and clear visual feedback. Power-ups, such as oversized tools or jelly weapons, temporarily shift the pace and encourage different approaches to destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/85c6c4f9837479827b5df2936203781e.poster.avif?t=1785151692\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/85c6c4f9837479827b5df2936203781e.webm?t=1785151692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/85c6c4f9837479827b5df2936203781e.mp4?t=1785151692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENERGY &amp; FUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game is not designed as a fitness experience, you may find that after demolishing a couple of environments you feel unexpectedly energized especially after a long or stressful day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/0f6d7a3e096da50b3014aa4d924f5679.poster.avif?t=1785151692\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/0f6d7a3e096da50b3014aa4d924f5679.webm?t=1785151692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/extras/0f6d7a3e096da50b3014aa4d924f5679.mp4?t=1785151692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I’m Having a Bad Day is a straightforward, physics-driven VR game built around short bursts of action and repeatable levels, created for players who enjoy quick sessions and physical interaction in virtual space.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Smash your stress away in a fast-paced cartoon VR experience where you compete in a chaotic reality show. Break, dismantle and unleash exaggerated physics-driven destruction in short, intense levels. Easy to jump into, hard to stop, perfect for quick sessions and surprisingly energizing fun.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/1a70f9726aa8308a1e0474d75d06df0381c3677c/header.jpg?t=1785151692", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/78946b60d9c47f7abdb513f95d5601a34eafa302/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785151692", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798970/78946b60d9c47f7abdb513f95d5601a34eafa302/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785151692", "website": "https://www.havingabadday.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><stro